G90
G0 Z5 F10000
MOVE_TO_DISCARD_FILAMENT_POSITION
M109 S210
ROUGHLY_CLEAN_NOZZLE
MOVE_TO_XY_IDLE_POSITION_EXTRUDER
FINELY_CLEAN_NOZZLE_STAGE_1
M104 S170
G0 Z5 F10000
MOVE_TO_DISCARD_FILAMENT_POSITION
ROUGHLY_CLEAN_NOZZLE
MOVE_TO_XY_IDLE_POSITION_EXTRUDER
FINELY_CLEAN_NOZZLE_STAGE_2

;===== 精回零 =================
M106 S255
M109 S170
M190 S100
M107 P2
G90
G0 Z5 F10000
G28 Z

;===== 热床调平 =================
; Always pass `ADAPTIVE_MARGIN=0` because Orca has already handled `adaptive_bed_mesh_margin` internally
; Make sure to set ADAPTIVE to 0 otherwise Klipper will use it's own adaptive bed mesh logic
BED_MESH_CALIBRATE mesh_min=33.7409,28.4867 mesh_max=237.259,256.904 ALGORITHM=bicubic PROBE_COUNT=6,6 ADAPTIVE=0 ADAPTIVE_MARGIN=0
